  name and description are the owner's sheet ruling 2026-10-05. Free RM_ tier, ONE HOME: the Abyss. Stats, tools,
  race fields and pawnkind numbers are the donor's own (its body is already vanilla), EXCEPT these donor-only
  references:
    - deathAction AlphaBehavioursAndEvents.DeathActionWorker_SummonEclipse (darkness on death) dropped, and the
